<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S5.SS6" title="In 5 Evaluation ‣ Harmless Yet Harmful: Neutral Prompting Attacks for Stealthy Hallucination Steering in Agent Skills" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5.6 </span>RQ5: What Makes Neutral Prompts Effective?</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S6" title="In Harmless Yet Harmful: Neutral Prompting Attacks for Stealthy Hallucination Steering in Agent Skills" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">6 </span>Discussion</span></a>
