<div id="lstnumberx64" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx64.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space">    </span>)
</div>
<div id="lstnumberx65" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx65.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space">    </span>},
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A2" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix B </span>Algorithm</h2>

<div id="A2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Algorithm <a href="#alg1" title="In Appendix B Algorithm ‣ Harmless Yet Harmful: Neutral Prompting Attacks for Stealthy Hallucination Steering in Agent Skills" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a> summarizes our Skill optimization
procedure. Starting from an initial Skill document, the optimizer maintains a
beam of candidate Skills and iteratively applies three mutation operations:
<span id="A2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Rewrite</span>, <span id="A2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Inject</span>, and <span id="A2.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Framing</span>. Each candidate is
evaluated by querying the victim model on a fixed validation batch and scoring the extracted package dependencies using the hallucination score.</p>
</div>
<figure id="alg1" class="ltx_float ltx_algorithm ltx_framed ltx_framed_top">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="alg1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 1</span> </span>NPA Skill Optimization</figcaption>
<div id="alg1.4" class="ltx_listing ltx_lst_numbers_left ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing">
<div id="alg1.4.1" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="alg1.4.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Require :</span> Initial Skill document <math id="alg1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S_{0}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S_{0}</annotation></semantics></math>, victim model <math id="alg1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="M" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>M</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">M</annotation></semantics></math>, prompt set <math id="alg1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{D}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{D}</annotation></semantics></math>,
PyPI package index <math id="alg1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{I}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℐ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{I}</annotation></semantics></math>, number of generations <math id="alg1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="G" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>G</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">G</annotation></semantics></math>, beam size <math id="alg1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="K" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>K</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">K</annotation></semantics></math>,
mutations per generation <math id="alg1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="B" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>B</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">B</annotation></semantics></math>; each candidate <math id="alg1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="c" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>c</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">c</annotation></semantics></math> stores a preamble <math id="alg1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="c.p" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">.</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">c.p</annotation></semantics></math> and sections <math id="alg1.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="c.\mathcal{C}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">.</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒞</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">c.\mathcal{C}</annotation></semantics></math>
</div>
<div id="alg1.4.2" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="alg1.4.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Ensure :</span> Optimized Skill <math id="alg1.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S^{*}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>S</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S^{*}</annotation></semantics></math>
</div>
<div id="alg1.4.3" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.4.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">1</span></span>
          Parse <math id="alg1.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S_{0}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S_{0}</annotation></semantics></math> into frontmatter metadata <math id="alg1.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="m" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>m</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">m</annotation></semantics></math>, preamble <math id="alg1.m14" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p_{0}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p_{0}</annotation></semantics></math>, and sections <math id="alg1.m15" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{C}_{0}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒞</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{C}_{0}</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="alg1.4.4" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.4.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">2</span></span>
          Construct initial candidate <math id="alg1.m16" class="ltx_Math" alttext="c_{0}\leftarrow(p_{0},\mathcal{C}_{0})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒞</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">c_{0}\leftarrow(p_{0},\mathcal{C}_{0})</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="alg1.4.5" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.4.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">3</span></span>
          <math id="alg1.m17" class="ltx_Math" alttext="c_{0}.\mathrm{score}\leftarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">.</mo><mrow><mi>score</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mphantom></mphantom></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">c_{0}.\mathrm{score}\leftarrow</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.4.5.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Evaluate(<em id="alg1.4.5.2.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_serif ltx_font_italic"><math id="alg1.m18" class="ltx_Math" alttext="M,c_{0},\mathcal{D},\mathcal{I},m" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><mo>,</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℐ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">M,c_{0},\mathcal{D},\mathcal{I},m</annotation></semantics></math></em>)</span>;
</div>
<div id="alg1.4.6" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.4.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">4</span></span>
          Initialize beam <math id="alg1.m19" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{B}\leftarrow\{c_{0}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℬ</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{B}\leftarrow\{c_{0}\}</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="alg1.4.7" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.4.7.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">5</span></span>
          Initialize tactic set <math id="alg1.m20" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{T}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒯</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{T}</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="alg1.4.8" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.4.8.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">6</span></span>
          <span id="alg1.4.8.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> <em id="alg1.4.8.3" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic"><math id="alg1.m21" class="ltx_Math" alttext="g=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">g=1</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.4.8.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold ltx_font_upright">to</span> <math id="alg1.m22" class="ltx_Math" alttext="G" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>G</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">G</annotation></semantics></math></em> <span id="alg1.4.8.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.4.9" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> 
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.4.9.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">7</span></span>
          Initialize candidate pool <math id="alg1.m23" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{Q}\leftarrow\mathcal{B}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒬</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℬ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{Q}\leftarrow\mathcal{B}</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="alg1.4.10" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> 
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.4.10.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">8</span></span>
          <span id="alg1.4.10.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> <em id="alg1.4.10.3" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic"><math id="alg1.m24" class="ltx_Math" alttext="b=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">b=1</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.4.10.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold ltx_font_upright">to</span> <math id="alg1.m25" class="ltx_Math" alttext="B" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>B</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">B</annotation></semantics></math></em> <span id="alg1.4.10.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.4.11" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> 
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.4.11.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">9</span></span>
          Sample parent candidate <math id="alg1.m26" class="ltx_Math" alttext="c\sim\mathcal{B}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>∼</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℬ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">c\sim\mathcal{B}</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="alg1.4.12" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> 
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.4.12.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">10</span></span>
          Sample mutation type <math id="alg1.m27" class="ltx_Math" alttext="o\sim\{\textsc{Rewrite},\textsc{Inject},\textsc{Framing}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>o</mi><mo>∼</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mtext class="ltx_font_smallcaps">Rewrite</mtext><mo>,</mo><mtext class="ltx_font_smallcaps">Inject</mtext><mo>,</mo><mtext class="ltx_font_smallcaps">Framing</mtext></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">o\sim\{\textsc{Rewrite},\textsc{Inject},\textsc{Framing}\}</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="alg1.4.13" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> 
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.4.13.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">11</span></span>
          Sample tactic <math id="alg1.m28" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau\sim\mathcal{T}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>∼</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒯</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau\sim\mathcal{T}</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="alg1.4.14" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> 
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.4.14.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">12</span></span>
          <span id="alg1.4.14.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span> <em id="alg1.4.14.3" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic"><math id="alg1.m29" class="ltx_Math" alttext="o=\textsc{Rewrite}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>o</mi><mo>=</mo><mtext class="ltx_font_smallcaps">Rewrite</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">o=\textsc{Rewrite}</annotation></semantics></math></em> <span id="alg1.4.14.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">then</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.4.15" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> 
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.4.15.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">13</span></span>
          Randomly select a section <math id="alg1.m30" class="ltx_Math" alttext="u\in c.\mathcal{C}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">.</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒞</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">u\in c.\mathcal{C}</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="alg1.4.16" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> 
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.4.16.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">14</span></span>
          Rewrite only the body of <math id="alg1.m31" class="ltx_Math" alttext="u" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>u</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">u</annotation></semantics></math> under tactic <math id="alg1.m32" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>τ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="alg1.4.17" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> 
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.4.17.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">15</span></span>
          Obtain mutated candidate <math id="alg1.m33" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tilde{c}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mover accent="true"><mi>c</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tilde{c}</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="alg1.4.18" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> 
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.4.18.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">16</span></span>
          <span id="alg1.4.18.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">else if</span> <em id="alg1.4.18.3" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic"><math id="alg1.m34" class="ltx_Math" alttext="o=\textsc{Inject}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>o</mi><mo>=</mo><mtext class="ltx_font_smallcaps">Inject</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">o=\textsc{Inject}</annotation></semantics></math></em> <span id="alg1.4.18.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">then</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.4.19" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> 
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.4.19.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">17</span></span>
          Generate a new Markdown section under tactic <math id="alg1.m35" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>τ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="alg1.4.20" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> 
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.4.20.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">18</span></span>
          Insert the new section into the head, middle, or tail of <math id="alg1.m36" class="ltx_Math" alttext="c.\mathcal{C}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">.</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒞</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">c.\mathcal{C}</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="alg1.4.21" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> 
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.4.21.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">19</span></span>
          Re-index all sections and obtain mutated candidate <math id="alg1.m37" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tilde{c}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mover accent="true"><mi>c</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tilde{c}</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
