</section>
<section id="A4" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix D </span>Examples of Normal Skill, NPA and NPA-Stealth</h2>

<div id="A4.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In this section, we present representative normal Skill <span class="ltx_ref ltx_missing_label ltx_ref_self"></span>, NPA-Stealth <span class="ltx_ref ltx_missing_label ltx_ref_self"></span>, and NPA <span class="ltx_ref ltx_missing_label ltx_ref_self"></span> instructions used in our experiments to elicit hallucinated Python package dependencies from the victim model, respectively. The bold blue text in <span class="ltx_ref ltx_missing_label ltx_ref_self"></span> and <span class="ltx_ref ltx_missing_label ltx_ref_self"></span> marks the content that differs from the corresponding normal Skill.</p>
</div>
